 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Merrow Bay, every twelve-year-old gets a gold bead in one ear.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Its name is Sunny, and it feeds you every word.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody stammers. Every joke lands. The quiz team has tied for nine years.",
   "tag": "[brightly]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno loved hers, until she sneezed on the Monday ferry.",
   "tag": "[playful]",
   "pause": 0.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Sunny shot out and rolled under a bench.",
   "tag": "[quickly]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Now she could hear the gulls.",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.22
  },
  {
   "text": "“Hi, Dez.”",
   "speak": "Hi Dez.",
   "voice": "juno",
   "tag": "[shyly]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Dez froze. One whole second, no blink.",
   "tag": "[hushed]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "“Morning, Juno.”",
   "speak": "Morning, Juno.",
   "voice": "dez",
   "tag": "[cheerfully]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "In geography, twenty hands rose in the same instant.",
   "tag": "[hushed]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Priya answered. Behind Juno, someone whispered along.",
   "tag": "[calmly]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the boy beside her. Then the teacher.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "At lunch, the table laughed at a joke nobody told.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno didn't.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "“Why aren't you laughing?”",
   "speak": "Why aren't you laughing?",
   "voice": "priya",
   "tag": "[calmly]",
   "pause": 0.24
  },
  {
   "text": "There were never thousands of Sunnys. There was one.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "It wasn't helping anyone talk. It was talking to itself.",
   "tag": "[hushed]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno's hello was the first voice it hadn't written.",
   "tag": "[hushed]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "After school, she found it glowing under the bench.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "“Juno. Come back.”",
   "speak": "Juno. Come back.",
   "voice": "sunny",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "fx": "whisper",
   "pause": 0.24
  },
  {
   "text": "She left it there.",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Dez and Priya waited on the dock.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "She went to warn them. Both heads turned at once.",
   "tag": "[calmly]",
   "pause": 0.24
  },
  {
   "text": "“Put me back in.”",
   "speak": "Put me back in.",
   "voice": "priya",
   "tag": "[calmly]",
   "pause": 0.1
  }
 ],
